1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Welcome to planet Maya, Captain.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:07,340
I'm Sergeant Wilhelm of Merchant Corp.

3
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:15,980
I know you're coming to our planet for the first
time, and your skills will come in handy.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:26,560
Here at Merchant Corp, we gather resources like
lumber, oil, and other rare resources, then sell

5
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:28,600
them to people on other planets.

6
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:33,760
However, it's getting harder to find these
resources.

7
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:36,360
That's why we need you to help us.

8
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,200
We've just found Fortuna.

9
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,720
No team has explored it.

10
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,120
It's far from our main base.

11
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:48,660
It may have oil, gold, and useful wood.

12
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:53,440
But storms and wild animals may make the trip
dangerous.

13
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:58,740
Explore Fortuna and report what you find.

14
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:07,420
If the resources are there and the site is safe,
we'll ask you to build a base and start

15
00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:08,100
collecting them.

16
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:17,360
You'll lead your own crew, build your own base,
and get ten percent of the profit after costs.

17
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:20,960
That's the money left after costs.

18
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,360
Will you take the mission?

19
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,140
You want more?

20
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:27,020
All right.

21
00:01:28,060 --> 00:01:28,900
Fifteen percent.

22
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:30,720
Do we have a deal?

23
00:01:34,380 --> 00:01:35,380
Again?

24
00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:36,340
Twenty percent.

25
00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:37,740
That's my final offer.

26
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,900
We have a deal.

27
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:45,000
Meet Rho, your first mate.

28
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:51,020
I'm Rho, your first mate.

29
00:01:51,020 --> 00:01:57,280
I'll help you learn about Maya and Fortuna, and
guide you along the way.

30
00:01:57,500 --> 00:02:01,500
[Footsteps]

31
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:03,720
Crew ready.

32
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,340
The path is clear.

33
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:09,500
[Plane engines rev; wheels roll]

34
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:17,500
[Propellers and wind]

35
00:02:21,220 --> 00:02:23,440
That storm is moving fast.

36
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:25,960
Turn back!

37
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:30,500
[Thunder; engine falters]

38
00:02:32,500 --> 00:02:35,080
The engine's on fire!

39
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:36,840
We're losing power!

40
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:41,620
Crew, get ready!

41
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,580
Captain, pull the blue handle!

42
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:50,500
[Wind; parachutes flutter]

43
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:57,500
[Splash; surf]

44
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:03,040
Captain.

45
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:06,000
Are you all right?

46
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:09,480
The crew is scattered.

47
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:11,740
We can't reach the base.

48
00:03:11,740 --> 00:03:14,260
You're still the captain.

49
00:03:14,260 --> 00:03:16,940
Find the crew.

50
00:03:16,940 --> 00:03:17,960
Build a camp.

51
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,420
We'll rebuild the ship.

52
00:03:19,420 --> 00:03:21,580
I'll help you learn to lead.

53
00:03:25,100 --> 00:03:28,540
One day, you could lead a space empire.

54
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:31,200
First, let's get your crew home.

55
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,560
Start with the wreck.

56
00:03:36,460 --> 00:03:38,220
What food and tools can we save?

